[229.265144, "o", "## Investigation Brief 02 — Status Precedence\r\n"]
[229.265189, "o", "\r\n"]
[229.26521, "o", "Auditor directive (mandatory for extract):\r\n"]
[229.265228, "o", "\r\n"]
[229.265246, "o", "Interview notes with the compliance desk confirmed status fights between mail,\r\n"]
[229.265263, "o", "amendments, and corrections. Ledger rows provide the base status (lowercase on\r\n"]
[229.265294, "o", "output). Status precedence from lowest to highest is: pending, approved,\r\nrejected, reversed. Email excerpts may change status only when the From line\r\n"]
[229.295549, "o", "contains `compliance@` anywhere in the address; ignore all other senders.\r\n\r\n"]
[229.295852, "o", "\u001b[?2004hroot@64435c900e2e:/app# "]
