[369.351461, "o", " advised preserving the full thread because downstream exception coding depends on mail timestamps.\r\n319-\r\n320-## Case Study 03 — Sox Sampling Mismatch\r\n321-\r\n322-Interview #796 with internal audit highlighted how SOX sampling mismatch statements were forwarded without the matching ledger row. Counsel advised preserving the full thread because downstream exception coding depends on mail timestamps.\r\n\u001b[?2004hroot@64435c900e2e:/app# "]
